  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Apoyo al Fortalecimiento de PROSPERA, Programa de Inclusin Social</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support For Stengthening Prospera, Social Inclusion Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo de la operacin es contribuir al desarrollo de capacidades y apoyar el consumo de familias en situacin de pobreza, mediante inversiones que mejoren sus condiciones de nutricin, salud y educacin.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this operation is to contribute to the development of capabilities and to support consumption of poor families, through investments that improve their nutrition, health and education.</narrative>
  </description>
